+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given a started form with email, when the applicant changes section, then a debounced upsert persists field values (no files, no consent, no `_`-fields) verifiable in the DB.
+- Given a saved draft, when the applicant requests a link and opens it, then the form renders pre-filled at the first incomplete section with the restored banner, `resumed_at` set, documents empty.
+- Given a resumed draft, when the applicant submits successfully, then the application inserts and the draft is stripped with `submitted_at` set.
+- Given a closed/expired vacancy, when the retention job runs, then its drafts are deleted; given a continue email, when the applicant uses the erasure link, then the draft is deleted after confirmation.
+- Given a stage-2 reminder to an enquirer with a draft, when the email builds, then its CTA is the tokenized continue-link; without a draft it stays the plain application URL.
+- Given no JS, the prep block keeps the one-visit line and the form submits as today; given JS, it promises save-and-continue.
+- `make test` and `make test-integration` green.
