+## Design Notes
+
+- A dedicated `view_resume_page` (not `view_form_with_errors(errors: [])`) keeps the analytics marker honest; the resume page suppresses the section funnel like form-errors (pre-filled values would fake completions) and fires `application_draft_resumed` instead.
+- Cooldown (10 min on `last_link_sent_at`) is the server-side abuse bound; a Cloudflare edge rule is a documented follow-up, not this PR.
+- Squirrel trap (field notes): own docker test DB on a free port, `TEST_DB_PORT` for `scripts/reset-test-db.sh`, then `cd server && DATABASE_URL=postgresql://test:test@localhost:<port>/righttenantry_test gleam run -m squirrel`; revert whitespace churn in `server/src/ai/sql.gleam` afterwards.
+
