+// -- Save-and-resume (F3, 2026-07 completion session) -------------------------
+//
+// Applicant-facing copy for draft save/resume. The prep-note swap and the
+// continue-link button strings ALSO live in `priv/static/form_draft.js`
+// (plain static JS can't import Gleam) — KEEP IN SYNC, same precedent as
