+-- Send-failure companion to claim_continue_link_send: the claim stamps the
+-- cooldown BEFORE the Resend call (atomicity against concurrent clicks), so
+-- a failed send must clear the stamp or the applicant's retry would be
+-- cooldown-skipped for 10 minutes with the UI saying "try again". Mirrors
+-- inbound_handler's clear_rejected_stamps precedent.
+UPDATE application_draft
