+
+/// - delete_expired_application_drafts()
+/// F3 draft expiry: drafts die at vacancy close (manual status='closed' or
+/// closes_at in the past — the latter also catches the daily lifecycle
+/// auto-close window) or at archive (an archived vacancy stops accepting via
+/// is_accepting_applications, so its drafts are unreachable dead PII). Runs
+/// inside the retention job's per-phase fail-open pattern.
